# REST Client (.http) Test File
# Use this file with VS Code's "REST Client" extension, IntelliJ HTTP Client, or similar IDE plugins.

@baseUrl = https://httpbin.org
@authToken = mock-bearer-token-12345

### 1. GET Request (Simple)
# Retrieves data from the server
GET https://port4004-workspaces-ws-ok3n6.us10.trial.applicationstudio.cloud.sap/chat/PurchaseOrders/get
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET Request with Query Parameters & Custom Headers
# Retrieves data with query params and custom headers
GET https://port4004-workspaces-ws-ok3n6.us10.trial.applicationstudio.cloud.sap/chat/PurchaseOrders/get?name=Alice&role=admin
User-Agent: vscode-restclient
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Custom-Header: custom-value

###

### 3. POST Request with JSON Body
# Creates a new resource with JSON data
POST https://port4004-workspaces-ws-ok3n6.us10.trial.applicationstudio.cloud.sap/chat/PurchaseOrders/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bob Smith",
    "email": "bob@example.com",
    "interests": ["coding", "HTTP spec", "automation"]
}

###

### 4. POST Request with Form URL-Encoded Body
# Simulates a standard HTML form submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=bobsmith
&password=supersecretpassword
&grant_type=password

###

### 5. PUT Request (Replace Resource)
# Replaces target resource with new representation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/put
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 42,
    "status": "updated",
    "tags": ["prod", "stable"]
}

###

### 6. PATCH Request (Partial Update)
# Modifies parts of the target resource
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patch
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "archived"
}

###

### 7. DELETE Request
# Deletes target resource
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete

###

### 8. POST Request with Multipart Form Data (File Upload)
# Simulates a file upload form
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text_field"

This is some text input.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file_field"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello, this is the content of the uploaded text file!
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
###
GET {{https://port4004-workspaces-ws-ok3n6.us10.trial.applicationstudio.cloud.sap/chat/PurchaseOrders(1)}}
Accept: application/json


### Get all Purchase Orders
GET https://port4004-workspaces-ws-ok3n6.us10.trial.applicationstudio.cloud.sap/chat/PurchaseOrders
Accept: application/json

### Get single PO by UUID
GET https://port4004-workspaces-ws-ok3n6.us10.trial.applicationstudio.cloud.sap/chat/PurchaseOrders(f1000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001)
Accept: application/json